{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_st02",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_st02",
  "title": "酒杯",
  "storyCode": "MN-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0b32c163ee3933ef6078bad6987363c3be0916ad3688399b192f60de44470f3e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 纯2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恰爾內先生，來質問的部門通訊一個接一個，我們完全顧不過來......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想辦法應付一下，至少讓還能聽得進話的人明白，“勝利”和“價值”不是同等的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“左手”閣下，您真的不需要進一步的醫療檢查？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必，能趁我施放法術前讓我失去意識已是她的極限，想確實給我留下重傷，她還嫩了點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恕我直言，這場比賽結果的確出乎了許多人的預料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有沒有這場無關緊要的勝利，我都會帶著鋒盔騎士團全員進入特錦賽。不勞發言人費心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您很有自信，這就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您全力以赴，瑪莉婭·臨光不會有任何勝算，希望您能應付這次意外失敗帶來的各種問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當然不會給自己找藉口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您會與很多巨額贊助無緣，也許您的騎士團那邊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——如果那些人還只能看見最表面的勝負而不懂得操作利益，那就是他們不配與我合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熱度能轉化成效益，客戶們在意的本來就只是他們能看到的那部分，換言之，他們其實只在意一些感官刺激......而且從無自覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過我沒想到，泰特斯·白楊閣下居然也會將自己的“失敗”明碼標價......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_105",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "發言人，不要挑釁我的底線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好、我很抱歉......等我們的小夥計處理完那些麻煩事，我們立刻就離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我們在特錦賽上相見吧，“左手”閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣......原來索娜她們在做這種事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者的鬥士競技場，我聽說過這個賽制......不，這都算不上“賽制”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論是否是騎士家族出身，任何人都可以成為競技騎士，並靠自己的本事贏得騎士協會的認可，從而躋身貴族行列......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們允許感染者參賽，但沒有任何一個國家會坐視感染者成為社會的中流砥柱，所以他們區分了一個額外賽制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者能賺到錢，能活命，但這輩子就會變成單純的角鬥士供人取樂......嘁，這種施捨根本沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我沒別的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這老東西，講話就不能委婉一點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在委婉給誰看啊，他們都要殺到鼻子上來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然感染者的事情的確讓人放不下心......不過現在不是擔心她們的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們靠著自己的實力改變了自己作為感染者的地位......但她們救下了很多的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我們要改變什麼，我們就需要繼續前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......瑪莉婭，已經變成能說出這種話的騎士小姐了......瑪嘉烈要是看到了，一定會很欣慰的吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別把耀騎士說得像是死了一樣，你這老傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你在曲解我的意思，科瓦爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭？怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒什麼....."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冠軍牆啊......真是個一點都不適合聊天的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......歷代冠軍像啊，這個黑騎士姐姐占了整整三幅呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明統治了特錦賽那麼多年，一點看不出來變老......欸，不會吧，看著看著總覺得比我還年輕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐說笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是血統的優勢嗎，真好啊，真羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑騎士在騎士競技歷史上留下了濃墨重彩的一筆，起初誰也沒想到一個完全不懂得法術的萊塔尼亞人能變成今天的“黑騎士”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過她的時代早已過去......她也離開了卡西米爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們居然會輕易放手這棵搖錢樹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......具有統治力的冠軍的確會引來不少崇拜者，但是過於膨脹的個人秀從長遠看不利於整個競技業的發展......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡單來說，雖然新的挑戰者挑戰黑騎士的確是賣點，但是連續三次都沒能撼動她的勝利......就稍顯無聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑騎士的末路不算太好，檯面上暗地裡想要排除她的人能擠滿一座競技場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過她運氣不錯，就在她窮途末路的時候，她遇到了謝拉格的一位大人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對方提出了一個還算不錯的價格......讓所有人接受了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能合理地更新換代，也是競技產業進步的體現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......然後就是這邊，一個空位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耀騎士嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，不用多說了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個人我知道，上一屆的，血騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血騎士的恐怖和強大是賽場上前所未見的，不過他倒是懂得審時度勢，沒有給我們添太多麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們偶爾也該勸勸他，不要用藥過度。騎士不是最貴重的商品嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謹記在心，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......於是呢？商業聯合會發言人邀請我來，不會是來聊歷史的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請原諒我選在這個地方，冠軍牆將在特錦賽期間向客人們開放，我得提前視察一下現場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，這也是少數能不被打擾和小姐談話的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......行啦，又是工作對吧，反正也跑不掉，我會聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不止是工作......不知小姐可否知曉，青金大位的兩人如今在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你沒有那個權限哦。雖然我也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說了一些有趣的小道消息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道什麼天大的事情，需要兩位青金大位同時帶隊行動呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——啊啊，我不想聽，我什麼都沒聽見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我確認過其他幾位負責人的全部申請，沒有一件“大事”需要用得上青金大位的，何況還是兩位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這你就不用擔心了，我只能保證這依舊是商業聯合會的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來如此......那我就放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......對我真是毫無信任啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何出此言呢，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你明知道找我問上位者的事情是沒有意義的，不就是想警告我這個“不成熟的白金大位”嘛，好啦好啦，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您很聰明，但我的疑惑也是千真萬確。即使上面隱瞞著我，我也必須把事情做得完美無瑕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，如果可以，請讓您的部下幫忙盯著一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恰爾內無言地看向身邊那空無一物的牆壁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪恩納·臨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然我覺得他終究只是個一事無成的廢物，不過還是要確保他不會干擾到我們接下來的進程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於您，小姐，您需要親自確保這件事能進行到底——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "疼——！輕、輕點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忍著點！這藥膏可貴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒和你上這一課是我的疏忽，如何在賽程中間合理安排自己的戰損也是一門講究。把頭髮撩起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我也沒料到會這麼——啊，痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又是英格拉又是白楊，你還四肢健全沒受過重傷已經算運氣好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，穿上衣服吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這幾天乖乖躺著別動，哪兒都不許亂跑，落下頑疾的舊傷是騎士最大的隱患，別像我這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝姑......佐菲婭姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭，那種戰鬥方法......你是怎麼想出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與其說是戰鬥方法......呃，其實是被迫的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那時候我腦子裡想的只是“先撐住總會有辦法的”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要因為這麼直白的原因就選擇這麼折磨自己的打法！累積的疲勞會讓接下來的戰鬥變得困難！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......幸好鑽了“左手”疏忽大意的漏洞，那個熱衷於折磨對方的變態要是決定真正動手......那才是真的很麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，佐菲婭姐姐以前遇上過他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他正式加入鋒盔騎士團的第一戰對手就是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那結果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以他現在絕不和別人提起他的出道戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但那都是過去的事了......騎士競技本來就有勝有負......他執念不在我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......泰特斯先生，似乎認識姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。連他在內的三個鋒盔騎士團成員在混戰賽中圍殺瑪嘉烈然後全部被幹掉，這種不可思議的事情誰能接受得了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐、姐姐這麼不留情面的嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那時候瑪嘉烈也很年輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......姐姐當時是怎麼想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼怎麼想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "印象裡姐姐最討厭的就是騎士競技吧......其實有段時間，我還覺得她和瑪恩納叔叔的想法很接近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是她還是去參加了騎士競賽，而且，成為了耀騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我也不知道她怎麼想的啊，但是，她應該比誰都清楚騎士競技意味著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算這樣，她還是去了，而且站上了山巔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但至少像我這樣單純欽佩著那個瑪嘉烈，頭腦一熱就成為了騎士的人不在少數啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誒嘿嘿.....其實我也有一點是因為這個啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許瑪嘉烈那次奪冠的意義就在於多幾個佐菲婭和瑪莉婭也說不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道姐姐現在在那個叫做羅德島的地方，過得好不好呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？別嚇人啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "劍、劍身上有個缺口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......最近一直沒有好好保養武器，會這樣也是理所當然的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你自己能搞定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，如果能借用科瓦爾師傅的工坊，說不定可以吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼了老弗？開車專心點，你總這副出神的樣子我可要下車叫計程車了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在想那兩隻小松鼠的事情......你敢現在下車我保證把你撞死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......感染者啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天我們差點動起手來，外面那些人......難道是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多半是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們也盯上了瑪莉婭？為啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......想多了吧，能不能念著丫頭點好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "後天下雨嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
